# Tawnos's Coffin exiles Bot2's Icatian Javelineers (a javelin counter and a +1/+1 counter from Honor) with both Auras on
# it - Bot2's Holy Strength and Bot1's Flight - but not Bot1's Lance on Ornithopter. Bot1 keeps the Coffin tapped through
# one untap step (it stays exiled), then lets it untap: the delayed ability returns Javelineers under its owner's control
# tapped with the noted +1/+1 counter and javelin counter - and a second javelin counter from its own "enters with a
# javelin counter", which applies to it entering this way too - and each Aura under its owner's control attached to it
# (CR 502.3, 603.7, 122.6, 614.1c).
# The {3} is paid from four black mana, one left; a noncreature artifact is no legal target. With one permanent to attach
# to, no Aura's owner is asked where it goes.
